desc: rk_svf - State Variable Filter (ReaKit suite)

/*
================================================================================
  rk_svf.jsfx-inc
================================================================================

  State Variable Filter library for the EON Studios ReaKit suite.
  Provides 14 filter types with smooth coefficient interpolation,
  cascading up to 96 dB/oct, magnitude response computation, and
  Mid/Side or Left/Right routing.

  This file is a port of Justin Johnson's S2GFX svf_filter.jsfx-inc as
  bundled with the Tukan plugin suite (e.g. "Orange EQ S2 (Tukan)" which
  declares `license: MIT`). Function identifiers have been namespaced
  `svf_` -> `rk_svf_` for collision-free coexistence with other ReaKit
  modules. DSP behavior is unchanged from the source.

  The original SVF math is taken from Andy Simper's (Cytomic) publicly-
  published paper:
    https://cytomic.com/files/dsp/SvfLinearTrapOptimised2.pdf
    (c) Andrew Simper, Cytomic, 2011-2013.

================================================================================
  ORIGINAL FILE LICENSE (preserved, with attribution)
================================================================================

